uestion/math-academy-id "q-69946" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ 4 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & \\frac{1}{4} \\\\ 4 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =1-1 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-69946/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69946"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-102757/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "6f5fe9a1-e27b-51e1-9f12-8aac97f5a6fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102757/selection/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer/id #uuid "dea6b2f1-c06a-5c00-8e2d-4b8993772041" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102757/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "36ec76f0-4ace-53dd-aad3-358aebfcc571" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-102757/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "c11732d5-a364-55ff-8c0c-1d5492e272b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/valid